        <mxCell id="5" value="Chân kết nối SX1278: - MOSI ──&gt; GPIO 27 - MISO &lt;── GPIO 19 - SCK  ──&gt; GPIO 18 (10 MHz) - NSS  ──&gt; GPIO 5 (CS) - RST  ──&gt; GPIO 14 - DIO0 &lt;── GPIO 26 (Ngắt TxDone) - VCC  ──&gt; 3.3V (Kèm tụ lọc) - GND  ──&gt; GND chung" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dcfce7;strokeColor=#16a34a;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#15803d;fontSize=11;arcSize=8;" vertex="1" parent="1">
