        <mxCell id="3" value="RASPBERRY PI COMPUTE MODULE 4 (CM4) (Broadcom BCM2711 Quad-Core @ 1.5 GHz) Đầu cắm GPIO 40-Pin Header Chạy hệ điều hành Linux 64-bit" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f0f9ff;strokeColor=#bae6fd;strokeWidth=1.5;verticalAlign=top;fontStyle=1;fontSize=12;fontColor=#0369a1;arcSize=6;" vertex="1" parent="1">
